## 6. Action Code Prefixes

| Prefix | Category | Examples |
|---------|-----------|-----------|
| **P** | Pricing | P1 Price Increase, P2 Tighten Discounts |
| **D** | Promotion / Demand | D1 Promo Calendar, D2 Campaign Optimization |
| **M** | Mix / Channel | M3 Channel Mix Steering |
| **PC** | Procurement | PC2 Renegotiate Terms, PC4 Supplier Scorecard |
| **I** | Inventory | I1 Safety Stock, I2 Allocation |
| **W** | Working Capital | W1 Collections, W2 Payment Terms |
| **C** | Customer | C1 Save Plays, C4 Upsell |
| **SP** | Strategy / Portfolio | SP1 Invest/Divest |
| **O** | Operations / Opex | O2 Efficiency, O3 Automation |

