## 7. Formatting and Unit Standards

| Unit Type | Format | Example |
|------------|---------|----------|
| Currency | € / dynamic currency | 1.234,56 € |
| Quantity | Whole number | 125 pcs |
| Percentage | 1–2 decimals, always with `%` | 85,3 % |
| Days / Time | Integer | 30 days |
| Text / Code | UpperCamelCase | ProductCategory |

